{"seq":25,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"2ef68dab-fde6-453f-89d6-da62271db39b","runId":"run_1_1788375321605","result":"Done! I've created a regex pattern that:\n\n1. **Validates IPv4 addresses** without leading zeros using a 4-part octet pattern:\n   - `25[0-5]` for 250-255\n   - `2[0-4]\\d` for 200-249  \n   - `1\\d{2}` for 100-199\n   - `[1-9]?\\d` for 0-99\n\n2. **Matches dates** in YYYY-MM-DD format with:\n   - Months: 01-12\n   - Days: 01-31 (February allowed up to 29)\n\n3. **Selects the last date** on each line using a negative lookahead that prevents matching if another date follows\n\n4. **Prevents false matches** with word boundaries (`(?<!\\w)` and `(?!\\w)`) to ensure dates and IPv4s aren't preceded/followed by alphanumeric characters\n\nThe single capturing group ensures `re.findall()` returns only the dates, one per matching line.","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":107595,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"2ef68dab-fde6-453f-89d6-da62271db39b","total_cost_usd":0.09858335,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15349,"cache_read_input_tokens":26321,"output_tokens":15100,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":14496},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":15349},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":769,"cache_read_input_tokens":13632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14406,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":14406,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1158,"outputTokens":18,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001248,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-4-5":{"inputTokens":17,"outputTokens"